OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be cloudy but mainly
OL,6,Fdry in the morning. Persistent rain,
OL,7,Fheavy at times with a chance of
OL,8,Fthunder, will extend east across all
OL,9,Fparts in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy in the evening as
OL,12,Foccasionally heavy rain spreads east
OL,13,Fwith a small chance of thunder.
OL,14,FScattered showers feed in from the
OL,15,Fwest overnight, some clear spells in
OL,16,Fthe east.
OL,17,
OL,18,CTuesday:FBright spells and scattered
OL,19,Fshowers, these heaviest in the morning
OL,20,Fwith a chance of lightning. Best of
OL,21,Fthe brightness in the southeast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
